seen beyond 4 m) and light (Bent Light: unseen beyond 3 m); an enemy that cannot see you cannot aim at you or close on you; rooted / pinned - rooted is an alias of pinned: one hold (40% speed, 2 s unless the skill says otherwise); hex / smite / seize / gaze - one kind, 'smite': an instant effect on the targeted enemy (gaze adds Dream's sight check); field_pulse - one kind shared by Death (corpses) and Nature (growth patches).",
